<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01243#dog_response_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene where a happy dog, looking up at the camera with an open mouth and tongue out, is positioned in the foreground against a grassy background. The dog is the central participant, and the scene is framed by text overlays that anthropomorphize its perspective, suggesting it is aware of being praised by its human. The dog's joyful expression and direct gaze create a humorous, self-aware interaction with the viewer."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#SemanticAdjacency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
