<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01243#anthropomorphism_in_meme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses anthropomorphism — attributing human characteristics, thoughts, and emotions to animals — to create humor. The dog is portrayed as self-aware and capable of understanding human praise, which is a common trope in internet memes and cartoons. This requires background knowledge of how anthropomorphism is used for comedic effect in popular culture."@en .
