<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01243#pet_human_bonding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme assumes a deep emotional bond between humans and their pets, particularly dogs, where pets are seen as affectionate, loyal companions who respond to their owners' affection and praise. This is a widely recognized social phenomenon in modern pet-owning societies, especially in Western cultures, and is essential to understanding the dog's 'self-aware' response to being called 'good girl'."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#diegeticallyIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates diegetic integration within the same fictional world"@en .
