<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01243#happiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The dog is displaying a wide, open-mouthed grin with its tongue out, eyes wide and bright, and ears perked forward, conveying a strong sense of joy and contentment. This expression is central to the meme's humor, as it anthropomorphizes the dog's self-satisfaction in response to being praised."@en .
